# The sdist carries the tests, so it must carry what the tests need.
#
# 2026-08-12: the zero-resonance regression fixture (the 400-crystal artifact
# that exhibited the grounded-fabrication defect) was absent from the sdist,
# so the guard `pytest.skip`ped for anyone who ran the tests from a released
# tarball. A guard that silently does not run is not a guard — the exact
# failure family the fixture exists to prove we fixed.
recursive-include tests/fixtures *
